# Training Compound: "{T}: Add {R} or {G}. Activate only if this land entered this turn or if you control a basic land." As Bot1's
# only land it enters untapped and, having entered this turn, taps for {R} (the first half of the condition) although Bot1 controls no
# basic land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Training Compound
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Training Compound.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Training Compound.Activate(Ability: {R} or {G}; Color: Red)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Training Compound.Tapped = true
Bot1.Mana = {R}
